          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP354 Alberta Beach?

Posted: N53 40.394 W114 20.753

GPSr: N53 40.394 W114 20.755

Elevation: 731 m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was the first cap of a wonderful multiple day trip to northwest to Peace River. The cap was easily found at the roadside and you can barely see it under its watery blanket. I forgot to take a context shot for this one, but had I taken one, it probably would have caught at least one local driving by wondering what the heck I was doing standing in a wet ditch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

